{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-p021c","title":"甄后临没托曹叡于李夫人","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-p021c-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"魏略称甄后临没以帝属李夫人。","evidence":["houfei-e-p021c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0016","role":"托孤","evidence":["houfei-e-p021c-q"]},{"person":"houfei-p0070","role":"受托","evidence":["houfei-e-p021c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"甄后临没","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-p021c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-p021c-q","source_order":[5,211,"P021c"],"order":1447},{"id":"houfei-e-p021d","title":"李夫人述甄后见谮及敛葬","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-p021d-account","label":"《魏略》","text":"李夫人在郭太后崩后述甄后见谮及不获大敛；魏略称曹叡命如甄后故事殡葬郭太后。","evidence":["houfei-e-p021d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0070","role":"述事","evidence":["houfei-e-p021d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"命殡葬","evidence":["houfei-e-p021d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"郭太后崩后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-p021d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-p021d-q","source_order":[5,211,"P021d"],"order":1448}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0070","name":"李夫人（甄后托孤）","evidence":["houfei-q-p021"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-p021-houfei-p0070","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p021"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-p021c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-71ae8080f5012cdc0a1a","layer":"pei","quote":"甄后临没，以帝属李夫人。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48fb337a59ce749f4b97","start":31,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-p021d-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-71ae8080f5012cdc0a1a","layer":"pei","quote":"及太后崩，夫人乃说甄后见谮之祸，不获大敛，被发覆面；帝哀恨流涕，命殡葬太后，皆如甄后故事。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48fb337a59ce749f4b97","start":43,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p021","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-71ae8080f5012cdc0a1a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“明帝既嗣立，追痛甄后之薨，故太后以忧暴崩。甄后临没，以帝属李夫人。及太后崩，夫人乃说甄后见谮之祸，不获大敛，被发覆面；帝哀恨流涕，命殡葬太后，皆如甄后故事。”《汉晋春秋》曰：“初，甄后之诛，由郭后之宠；及殡，令被发覆面，以糠塞口；遂立郭后，使养明帝。帝知之，心常怀忿，数泣问甄后死状。郭后曰：‘先帝自杀，何以责问我？且汝为人子，可追仇死父，为前母枉杀后母邪！’明帝怒，遂逼杀之；敕殡者，使如甄后故事。”","attribution":"《魏略》《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48fb337a59ce749f4b97","start":0,"end":211,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
